REM LONG.JVS - A SOURCE FILE USING MORE THAN ONE DISK BLOCK
PRINT THIS SOURCE USES MULTIPLE DISK BLOCKS.
PRINT IT ADDS THE NUMBERS FROM 1 THROUGH 10.
REM A HOLDS THE CURRENT VALUE; B HOLDS THE RUNNING TOTAL.
STORE 1 A
STORE 0 B
ADD A B B
INC A
IF A 11 11
GOTO 7
PRINT THE TOTAL SHOULD BE 55.
OUTPUT B
REM LARGER JVS FILES STILL USE ONE STATEMENT PER PHYSICAL LINE.
REM LINE NUMBERS ABOVE REFER TO THIS EXACT FILE.
END
